#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:5
#: 63c695aaae544e9b9bb821ef461c8df5
msgid "Mission Planner Advanced Installation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:7
#: 7d6ce87ade3f478f8b8654867b65cfdd
msgid "This article explains how you can change where Mission Planner is installed, and how to install older versions if needed (not recommended)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:12
#: caf90767b7d64af3ab762c8efcd342a4
msgid "Installing Mission Planner In a Different Location"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:14
#: d63a80bf7a4845dfb332377724f84f9a
msgid "Sometimes you may want to keep  or install the current or different version of Mission Planner in a folder different from the normal location used by the :ref:`MSI installation <install-mission-planner>`. You can do this by downloading the \"zip\" version which contains all the files necessary and placing the files into a folder of your choice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:21
#: ee709198a97f43d292639908c4dea5c3
msgid "Download the most recent Mission Planner ZIP Files"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:23
#: d76eae04d2084bf084d840e7fbe126ae
msgid "You can find all the different versions of Mission Planner zip (and MSI) files `here <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MissionPlanner/>`__. The most recent version of the zip file can be `downloaded from here <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MissionPlanner/MissionPlanner-latest.zip>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:27
#: 29af16610e5e47cc8a3b551ee8d3e641
msgid "Download and save the zip file to your computer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:30
#: 768e6aa45e8043f5939f32fb55652628
msgid "Install (Un-zip) the files to the desired folder"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:32
#: 32cf303e1d294c2bb5bde2fc27e1a8a9
msgid "Here is how you \"install\" a version into a different folder:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:34
#: cd59e99a35254944b35f21c5ebd2bbdf
msgid "Unzip the downloaded zip files into the folder where you want them installed. (see your winzip manual)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:37
#: c0f68c2ea48c41c1b371f887c5df947f
msgid "We suggest un-zipping to Program Files folder where the normal installation is, but with a different folder name I.E. a folder name like Mission Planner-xxx where xxx is the version number."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:40
#: afc300b5670440e4b5de51e94575d43e
msgid "After you do the un-zip, you should have all the files necessary to run that version of MP in the new folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:43
#: c13787ad2e49402b8301c3a2fcb297ac
msgid "You can run this version by double clicking on the MissionPlanner.exe file in the folder's root."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:45
#: a32926f29ece4747af74dbdba885abe7
msgid "Be sure to answer \"no\" to the upgrade notice if you want to stay with the version you are using in that folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:47
#: 9f8181ffafe64e98b565e585bde0bb74
msgid "To create a desktop icon for that version do this:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:49
#: 4de4246135784672802461f1a8c9c089
msgid "Find the file MissionPlanner.exe in the folder's root."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:50
#: 3010d9387bf44efdb0c10e10bae4de1e
msgid "Right click and hold the file name and drag it to your desktop"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:51
#: 77c2d4b52ee0417aa16d5d3a4baf16f5
msgid "Select the 'Create a shortcut here\" option when you release the mouse button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:53
#: 1b55c73d48c9477f9987f0e235f7a703
msgid "Right click on the new icon and select Rename."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:54
#: 9700458516d2400d81cacaed4bb4a858
msgid "Change the name to include the version number or some text to identify the icon to start this version of MP"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:58
#: c6fb5e2347524c40a69d50178801a7ac
msgid "Using older version of Mission Planner"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:60
#: ec02ffcaddbb44f186cf98301e15c00b
msgid "Using older versions of Mission Planner is discouraged because the latest version should work with most platforms and will have fewer bugs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:63
#: bfe775b6783344d884f13b366b066422
msgid "However if you are using an older APM with an older version of firmware that is working well for you it may make sense not to update the firmware. Alternatively you might have more than one platform (for instance a plane and a quad copter or two planes) and you want to keep a different version of the Mission Planner for each on your ground station.  This keeps the configuration files, the log files and saved parameter files separate - making life much easier."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:73
#: 3422f59cd5ae47b0930cae2fa68ab984
msgid "Use older versions of Mission Planner at your own risk.  Do not attempt to upgrade firmware with older versions. Each new platform firmware update usually requires the latest Mission Planner version."
msgstr ""
